@startuml
title C8 UoW commit with outbox -> relay -> SSE/Mercure -> TanStack Query; -> semantic.works deltas
participant "Aggregate session" as UOW
participant "SPARQL store" as ST
participant "Outbox relay" as R
participant "SSE endpoint / Mercure hub" as HUB
participant "Browser TanStack Query" as TQ
participant "delta-notifier" as DN
UOW -> ST : one DELETE/INSERT/WHERE {guards} + outbox event triples (admin graph)
UOW -> ST : ASK commit token
R -> ST : SELECT unpublished events ORDER BY seq LIMIT n
R -> HUB : publish {topic: aggregate IRI, type, version} (no data payload)
HUB -> TQ : SSE message (private topics need subscriber JWT)
TQ -> TQ : invalidateQueries(queryKey from IRI) -> refetch through API (authz applies)
R -> DN : POST {changeSets:[{insert,delete,effectiveInsert,effectiveDelete}]} quads + graph
R -> ST : mark events published (at-least-once; consumers dedupe by event IRI)
note over R, DN : delta format is quad-level: no aggregate id, no tx id, no version
@enduml
